@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Opening : fresh START,\nclosed confirmed
Opening --> Settling : open confirmed
Settling --> Watering : 2 s
Watering --> PumpStopping : 5 min
PumpStopping --> Closing : next scan
Closing --> Idle : closed confirmed

Settling --> FaultPumpStopping : low source water,\nopen confirmed,\nmotion permitted
Watering --> FaultPumpStopping
PumpStopping --> FaultPumpStopping
FaultPumpStopping --> FaultClosing : next scan
FaultPumpStopping --> Faulted : motion inhibited
FaultClosing --> Faulted : closed / 10 s /\nmotion inhibited
Faulted --> Idle : fresh RESET,\nreset allowed

state Opening : open ON (timeout 10 s)
state Watering : pump ON
state Closing : close ON (timeout 10 s)
state FaultPumpStopping : all motion OFF, alarm ON
state FaultClosing : close ON, alarm ON
state Faulted : all motion OFF, alarm ON

note as N
Checked first, every scan:
- any fault cause (except the orderly
  low-water case) -> Faulted, cause latched
- observation unavailable -> Faulted if a cause
  is latched, otherwise Idle
- normal STOP in Idle..Closing -> Idle (no alarm)
end note
@enduml
